  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking, and safe to take: every function that returned an anonymous record now returns a named type — WrapCounter, MemReadPort, EdgeDetect, AxiLiteChannel, the audio port records and the rest. Field names are unchanged, so source that reads .count or .data still compiles; anything compiled against alpha.1 must be recompiled. The payoff is that those fields now carry documentation, which ships in the package as XML and reaches your editor. Also: doc comments on the whole public surface, and several that were silently attached to the wrong declaration are now on the right one.",
